{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bourbon Risky</strong> is a retro-style boss rush action game. Armed with a shotgun -that occasionally fires lasers-, blast through anything that dares to stand in your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775970/extras/15c951a63ff58ad030aae89d7d2456b2.poster.avif?t=1773898697\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775970/extras/15c951a63ff58ad030aae89d7d2456b2.webm?t=1773898697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775970/extras/15c951a63ff58ad030aae89d7d2456b2.mp4?t=1773898697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use recoil to move dynamically!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your shotgun is so powerful that it pushes you to the other side the moment you fire. It can use recoil to go up high, or it can quickly fall in the air!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775970/extras/f1ad03ed02176df2a54b14255d684315.poster.avif?t=1773898697\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775970/extras/f1ad03ed02176df2a54b14255d684315.webm?t=1773898697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775970/extras/f1ad03ed02176df2a54b14255d684315.mp4?t=1773898697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And from your shotgun... a laser blasts out!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you successfully dodge an enemy\u2019s laser attack with a dash, your shotgun charges up\u2014empowering your next shot. Unleash a devastating charged blast and take down your foes with style!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3775970?t=1773898697","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775970/ece00eb9eb4efb71e0b29a9d7f7b0931f5a01886/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773898697","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775970/ba227cab13b3d1dd56de81d6cb7bcf705a23ad59/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773898697","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775970/ba227cab13b3d1dd56de81d6cb7bcf705a23ad59/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773898697","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4138660,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bourbon Risky</strong> is a retro-style boss rush action game. Armed with a shotgun -that occasionally fires lasers-, blast through anything that dares to stand in your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775970/extras/15c951a63ff58ad030aae89d7d2456b2.poster.avif?t=1773898697\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775970/extras/15c951a63ff58ad030aae89d7d2456b2.webm?t=1773898697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775970/extras/15c951a63ff58ad030aae89d7d2456b2.mp4?t=1773898697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use recoil to move dynamically!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your shotgun is so powerful that it pushes you to the other side the moment you fire. It can use recoil to go up high, or it can quickly fall in the air!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775970/extras/f1ad03ed02176df2a54b14255d684315.poster.avif?t=1773898697\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775970/extras/f1ad03ed02176df2a54b14255d684315.webm?t=1773898697\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775970/extras/f1ad03ed02176df2a54b14255d684315.mp4?t=1773898697\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And from your shotgun... a laser blasts out!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you successfully dodge an enemy\u2019s laser attack with a dash, your shotgun charges up\u2014empowering your next shot. Unleash a devastating charged blast and take down your foes with style!</p>","developers":["HaJoonHeon"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775970/9a95e68b608444c25fdbe660c6edd51da43d3f4b/header.jpg?t=1773898697","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3775970/1032183881/61fa60484b2cc2c5ff1da7571258d0e9a03ddd78/1760292541/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760292939","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3775970/1032183881/61fa6